k", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "噪波遮罩"}], "flags": {}, "id": 23, "type": "InpaintModelConditioning", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "InpaintModelConditioning"}, "order": 13}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [41], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "size": [270, 82], "pos": [1341.975830078125, 535.62353515625], "widgets_values": [3, 1.25], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 40, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"widget": {"name": "kernel_size"}, "name": "kernel_size", "label": "kernel_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "kernel_size"}, {"widget": {"name": "sigma"}, "name": "sigma", "label": "sigma", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "sigma"}], "flags": {}, "id": 30, "type": "UnsharpMask", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "UnsharpMask"}, "order": 16}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [63], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "size": [270, 178], "pos": [1325.6962890625, 707.5494384765625], "widgets_values": [20, 0, 3, 5, 8, 1], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 41, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "温度"}, {"widget": {"name": "hue"}, "name": "hue", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "色调"}, {"widget": {"name": "brightness"}, "name": "brightness", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "明度"}, {"widget": {"name": "contrast"}, "name": "contrast", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "对比度"}, {"widget": {"name": "saturation"}, "name": "saturation", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "饱和度"}, {"widget": {"name": "gamma"}, "name": "gamma", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "伽马"}], "flags": {}, "id": 29, "type": "ColorCorrect", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ColorCorrect"}, "order": 18}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": [" \n所有节点参数逐项表（照抄即可）\n下表为每个节点的完整参数。RunningHub 上节点名可能与本地略有差异，按功能对应即可。\n\n3.1 输入与模型加载\n节点编号\t节点名\t关键参数\t参数说明\n①\tLoadImage\timage: 原图\nupload: \"image\"（默认）\t建议输入 1024×1024 左右的正面/半身人像，光线均匀，背景简洁\n②\tUNETLoader\tunet_name: flux1-Fill-dev.safetensors\nweight_dtype: fp8_e4m3fn\tFlux Inpaint 专用模型，负责\"按蒙版重画\"；fp8 在 RunningHub 24GB 显存下流畅运行\n③\tDualCLIPLoader\tclip_name1: clip_l.safetensors\nclip_name2: t5xxl_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors\ntype: flux\tFlux 必须同时加载两个文本编码器；不要使用普通 CLIPLoader\n④\tVAELoader\tvae_name: ae.safetensors\tFlux 专属 VAE，与 SD1.5/SDXL 的 VAE 不通用，不能混用\n3.2 人脸蒙版生成（决定美化的\"精准度\"）\n节点编号\t节点名\t关键参数\t参数说明\n⑤\tBiRefNet / SAM / PersonMaskUltra V2\n（RunningHub 任一可用）\tmodel: 最新版 BiRefNet-General\ninput: ① 的 IMAGE\noutput: MASK\t生成\"皮肤+五官\"区域蒙版。关键：需排除\"眼睛内部\"和\"嘴唇内部\"，否则会改色瞳孔和牙齿\n⑥\tGrowMask\texpand: 6 px\ninvert: false\t把蒙版向外扩张 6 像素，覆盖发际线与脸颊过渡区\n⑥-B\tGaussianBlur\tkernel: 7\nsigma: 3.0\t柔化边缘，让 Flux 重绘与原图的拼接处\"溶\"进去，不出现硬边\n3.3 提示词编码\n节点编号\t节点名\t关键参数\t参数说明\n⑦\tCLIPTextEncode (Positive)\tclip: ③ 的 CLIP\ntext: 见下方提示词模板\t强调皮肤质感、柔和光照、保留毛孔；不要加\"ultra beautiful model\"之类会改人脸的关键词\n⑧\tCLIPTextEncode (Negative)\tclip: ③ 的 CLIP\ntext: plastic, over-smooth, blurry, deformed, cartoon, painting, jpeg artifacts, bad anatomy\tFlux 对负向提示敏感度较低，但仍建议写上；用来压制\"塑料感\"\n⑨\tConditioningZeroOut\tconditioning: ⑧ 输出\tFlux 官方推荐：将负向条件归零，避免干扰重绘\n⑩-A\tFluxGuidance（可选）\tguidance: 18.0\nconditioning: ⑦ 输出\t用于提升皮肤质感的\"强度\"。18 是默认，可上调至 25 强化毛孔细节；超过 35 易出现锐化伪影\n3.4 条件组装 + 采样\n节点编号\t节点名\t关键参数\t参数说明\n⑩\tInpaintModelConditioning\tpositive: ⑦ (或 ⑩-A)\nnegative: ⑨\nmask: ⑥-B\npixels: ① IMAGE\nvae: ④ VAE\nnoise_mask: false\t把蒙版、图像、VAE、正向/负向条件\"打包\"成 Flux Inpaint 需要的输入格式\n⑪\tKSampler\tseed: random\ncontrol_after_generate: fixed\nsteps: 22\ncfg: 1.0\nsampler_name: euler\nscheduler: simple\ndenoise: 0.35\nmodel: ②\tFlux Inpaint 四件套：\n· steps = 20–25（22 是甜蜜点）\n· cfg = 1.0（Flux 固定，不要改）\n· sampler = euler（或 euler_cfg_pp）\n· scheduler = simple / beta / normal 都可用\ndenoise 决定美化强度：0.25 轻度提亮，0.35 推荐，0.45 强磨皮（易丢特征）\n3.5 解码与输出\n节点编号\t节点名\t关键参数\t参数说明\n⑫\tVAEDecode\tsamples: ⑪ LATENT\nvae: ④ VAE\t把 Latent 解码回 IMAGE；若 RunningHub 提示显存不足，可换成 VAEDecodeTiled，tile_size=512\n⑬\tSaveImage / PreviewImage\tfilename_prefix: flux_beauty_\t预览满意后再 SaveImage；RunningHub 每次出图会扣算力\n3.6 可选后处理（让效果\"专业级\"）\n节点编号\t节点名\t关键参数\t参数说明\n⑭-A\tDetailerForEach（Impact Pack）\tguide_size: 512\ndetail_strength: 0.4\nfeather: 10\t只对脸部做一轮细节强化：眼睛更清澈、睫毛更分明、毛孔保留\n⑭-B\tColorCorrect\tL_boost: +6\na: +1.2\nb: +3.0\nsaturation: +0.05\tLAB 空间微调：L 提亮不超、a 加红润、b 去黄。所有值都是小幅修正，避免\"面具感\"\n⑭-C\tUnsharpMask\tradius: 2.5\namount: 0.35\nthreshold: 5\t局部对比度恢复，让皮肤纹理更\"瓷\"；amount 不要超过 0.5，否则出现锐化白边\n4\n提示词模板（直接复制粘贴）\n以下模板针对亚洲人像优化过，已避免常见的\"塑料感\"和\"偏色\"陷阱。\n\n4.1 正向提示词（节点 ⑦）\nretouch portrait photo, beautiful natural skin, fine skin texture, visible pores, subsurface scattering, soft studio lighting, clear eyes, delicate facial features, warm natural skin tone, high detail face, sharp focus on face, photorealistic, 8k uhd, DSLR quality\n复制\n4.2 负向提示词（节点 ⑧）\nplastic skin, over-smoothed, airbrushed, blurry, deformed, bad anatomy, cartoon, painting, 3d render, jpeg artifacts, noisy, oversaturated, pale, ashy skin, bad eyes, cross-eyed, extra fingers\n复制\n4.3 不同强度的\"美化档位\"提示词替换\n档位\t适用场景\t节点 ⑦ 替换提示词（节选）\tdenoise 配合\n轻度日常\t微信头像、证件照微调\tsubtle retouch, natural skin, soft light, keep freckles\t0.25\n中度推荐\t小红书、电商主图\tretouch portrait, beautiful skin, natural pores, soft lighting\t0.35\n重度精修\t杂志大片、海报\tmagazine portrait, flawless skin, perfect retouching, studio lighting\t0.42\n极重慎用\t艺术创作\tidealized portrait, porcelain skin, ethereal beauty\t0.50+\n⚠️\ndenoise 超过 0.45 后，Flux 会开始\"重塑\"人脸特征，导致\"不像本人\"。除非做艺术创作，否则不要超过 0.42。\n5\n在 RunningHub 上的具体操作步骤\n选择算力：默认 24GB 显存即可跑本工作流；如需同时跑后处理 DetailerForEach，建议升级到 RTX 4090 48G（proxy-plus）。\n新建工作流：点 \"新建\" → 空白工作流 → 按上图 14 个节点依次拖入画布并连线。\n模型文件：Flux.1-Fill-dev 需在 \"我的模型库\" 收藏；BiRefNet 和 ImpactPack 通常在 RunningHub 预装节点中已自带。\n上传原图测试：先用一张光线均匀的正面照做测试，参数用表中的\"推荐值\"，跑通后再微调。\n锁定 seed：找到满意效果后，在 KSampler 上把 control_after_generate 从 random 改成 fixed，该 seed 值后续可复现。\n批量处理：把 LoadImage 换成 Batch Load Image，配合 SaveImage 的 filename_prefix，可一次处理几十张。\n6\n常见翻车与排查表\n现象\t最可能的原因\t修复方案\n皮肤像塑料假人\tdenoise > 0.45 或提示词里有 \"flawless, perfect skin\"\t降 denoise 到 0.30–0.35；提示词改为 \"natural skin, visible pores\"\n脸部不像本人\tdenoise 过高 / FluxGuidance 过高\tdenoise ≤ 0.38；FluxGuidance 从 18 降到 14\n眼睛变色 / 瞳孔变灰\t蒙版包含了眼睛内部\t在节点 ⑤ 的分割模型中启用\"排除虹膜\"选项；或手动画 mask 排除眼球\n发际线有明显拼接痕迹\tGaussianBlur 不够 或 GrowMask 太小\tblur sigma 调到 4.0；GrowMask expand 加到 10px\n肤色偏青 / 偏蜡黄\tLAB 通道 a/b 没补偿\t加 ColorCorrect 节点：a +1.5, b +3.0（参考 ⑭-B）\n脖子比脸白很多（面具感）\t蒙版下边界太硬\tmask 底部做 20px 的垂直渐变；或把蒙版整体再 GrowMask 10px\n显存爆炸 / 任务失败\tVAEDecode 全图解码\t换成 VAEDecodeTiled，tile_size=512, overlap=64\n节点报错 \"missing model\"\tFlux 三件套没收藏到模型库\t在 RunningHub \"模型库\" 搜索 flux1-Fill-dev / clip_l / t5xxl_fp8 / ae.safetensors 全部收藏"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [611.8781127929688, 1880.234130859375], "pos": [2789.7568359375, -348.12030029296875], "id": 34, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["COMPENDIUM · ComfyUI × Flux · RunningHub 云端实战\nFlux 人像美化工作流指南\n\n面向 RunningHub 云端 ComfyUI 的「人像美化」完整工作流：从人脸蒙版提取、Flux Inpaint 重绘、皮肤质感强化到色彩校准， 全部节点参数逐项给出，附节点链路示意图与可直接复制的提示词模板。\n\n🎯 适用人群：ComfyUI 初学者 / 电商修图 / 人像摄影后期\n🧠 模型：Flux.1-dev + Flux.1-Fill-dev\n☁️ 平台：RunningHub（默认 24GB 显存即可）\n📐 分辨率：1024 × 1024 或 1:1 等比缩放\n\n工作流定位：我们要「美化」什么\n「人像美化」在本工作流中被拆成 4 个可控的子目标，避免一次性把所有诉求塞进 Flux，导致出现塑料感或偏色。\n\n① 皮肤匀净\n淡化痘印、斑点、细纹，保留真实毛孔\n② 肤色通透\n校正 LAB 空间 a/b 通道，去黄、提亮但不发灰 \n③ 五官立体\n保留高光与阴影过渡，眼睛更清澈有神\n④ 画质细腻\n在重绘后做局部细节增强，避免过度磨皮\n\n\n节点链路示意图（RunningHub 可直接照着搭）\n下图给出完整的节点连接关系。每个方框 = 一个 ComfyUI 节点；连线旁标注了要接的接口名；紫色虚线代表\"可选增强\"分支。\n\n输入：原始人像照片 size_limit: 2048 ② UNETLoader 模型：flux1-Fill-dev.safetensors weight_dtype: fp8_e4m3fn ③ DualCLIPLoader clip_l.safetensors t5xxl_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors ④ VAELoader ae.safetensors（Flux 专属 VAE） 类型：Flux-AE ⑤ BiRefNet / SAM 人脸分割 输入 = ① 的 IMAGE 输出：face_mask（仅皮肤+五官） 排除：眼睛内部、嘴唇内部 ⑥ GrowMask + GaussianBlur expand: 6 px ｜ blur: 3 px 作用：柔化蒙版边缘，避免拼接痕迹 ⑦ CLIPTextEncode（正） beautiful skin, natural pores, soft lighting, subsurface scattering, retouch portrait, no acne ⑧ CLIPTextEncode（负） plastic, over-smooth, blurry, deformed, cartoon, painting, jpeg artifacts ⑨ ConditioningZeroOut (负) 输入 = ⑧ 的 CONDITIONING Flux 规范：负向条件归零 输出 → InpaintModelConditioning ⑩ InpaintModelConditioning ★ 输入：⑦ 正向 / ⑨ 负向 / ⑥ mask pixels = ① IMAGE vae = ④ VAE 输出：positive/negative/latent ⑪ KSampler ★ 核心出图 seed: random ｜ control_after_generate: fixed steps: 22 ｜ sampler: euler scheduler: simple ｜ cfg: 1.0 denoise: 0.35 ｜ model = ② latent_image = ⑩ 的 latent positive/negative = ⑩ 输出 ⑩-A FluxGuidance（可选） 插入在 ⑦ 之后、⑩ 之前 guidance: 18.0（控制皮肤质感强度） ⑫ VAEDecode 输入：⑪ 的 LATENT + ④ VAE 输出：IMAGE（美化后的人像） ⑬ SaveImage / PreviewImage filename_prefix: flux_beauty_ 输出：1024×1024 美化人像 ⑭ 后处理（可选） DetailerForEach：脸部细节强化 guide_size: 512 ｜ detail_strength: 0.4 ColorCorrect：肤色 LAB 微调 L_boost: +6 ｜ a: +1.2 ｜ b: +3 UnsharpMask：radius 2.5, amount 0.35 IMAGE mask mask(soft) pixels positive neg zero-out vae pos/neg/lat model LATENT vae IMAGE 可选\n输入 / 模型加载   核心处理节点  输出   可选增强   必接   可选"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [574.2479248046875, 1893.3587646484375], "pos": [2177.318359375, -347.76275634765625], "id": 33, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MASK", "links": [12], "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [270, 82], "pos": [387.08221435546875, 817.428466796875], "widgets_values": [7, 3], "inputs": [{"name": "mask", "link": 10, "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "mask"}, {"widget": {"name": "kernel_size"}, "name": "kernel_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "大小"}, {"widget": {"name": "sigma"}, "name": "sigma", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "Sigma"}], "flags": {}, "id": 16, "type": "ImpactGaussianBlurMask", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node nam